---
version: 2.0.2
title: report help
file: ./test/licence_audit/output_snapshot_test.gleam
test_name: report_help_test
---
Report Hex package licences without enforcing policy findings. Operational
failures exit 2. Use `check` to enforce a licence policy.

Command: report

USAGE:
    licence_audit report [ --cache-dir=<DIR> --color=<auto|always|never>
        --config=<PATH> --format=<text|json> --ignore-config --manifest=<PATH>
        --no-cache --quiet --scope=<prod|all> --verbose ]

FLAGS:
    --cache-dir=<DIR>            Use DIR as the application cache root for all
                                 cache families

    --color=<auto|always|never>  Colorize output: auto|always|never (default
                                 auto; alias: --colour)

    --config=<PATH>              Read configuration from PATH

    --format=<text|json>         Output format: text|json (default text)

    --help                       Print help information

    --ignore-config              Ignore configuration files

    --manifest=<PATH>            Read manifest from PATH

    --no-cache                   Bypass the on-disk caches

    --quiet                      Suppress progress output (alias: -q)

    --scope=<prod|all>           Dependency scope: prod|all (production only or
                                 all dependencies)

    --verbose                    Show detailed progress output (alias: -v)

